  {
    "id": "330739",
    "original": "私は、この旅で心底共に戦った、スクラントン通りで育ち、デラウエアの自宅へ帰る電車に揺られるような人々に演説をしてきたパートナーに感謝したい。合衆国副大統領のジョー・バイデン氏だ。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "330451",
        "text": "I want to thank my partner in this journey, a man who campaigned from his heart, and spoke for the men and women he grew up with on the streets of Scranton, and rode with on the train home to Delaware, the vice president-elect of the United States, Joe Biden."
      }
    ],
